WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.440
Every consultation invites you to have your say.

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:08.230
I trace where it goes.

00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:11.770
Dr Ronja Oyelaran joined us from a state planning authority.

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:14.030
I brought one question with me.

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.010
What were we really asking?

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:19.571
A comment box on a bus-stop pole,

00:00:19.671 --> 00:00:23.491
where every slip counts as a completed consultation.

00:00:23.741 --> 00:00:26.321
Or a smoke-alarm survey,

00:00:26.421 --> 00:00:30.011
where the word working meant six different things.

00:00:30.361 --> 00:00:33.701
Her research funding puts her among the University's top ten.

00:00:34.151 --> 00:00:36.141
Nearly four hundred and twenty thousand dollars,

00:00:36.341 --> 00:00:38.301
from the Anticipatory Capability Fund.

00:00:38.551 --> 00:00:40.281
And an h-index of twenty-four.

00:00:41.181 --> 00:00:43.791
People take the time to have their say.

00:00:43.991 --> 00:00:46.191
The least we can do is read it.

00:00:47.391 --> 00:00:48.941
Her outputs are all on our website.

00:00:49.091 --> 00:00:50.206
Find us on Bluesky,

00:00:50.356 --> 00:00:51.146
or by email.
